[00:28.02]The prophets of old sought to learn of the Christ,
[00:31.96]The hope of all groaning creation.
[00:35.76]God’s spirit revealed that Messiah would come,
[00:39.93]Providing the means of salvation.
[00:43.30]The time has arrived, the Messiah now reigns,
[00:47.56]The proof of his presence is clear.
[00:51.20]How great is the favor of learning such things;
[00:55.14]Into these even angels would peer!
[00:59.25](Chorus)
[00:59.40]Our path now becomes ever brighter;
[01:03.98]We walk in the full light of day.
[01:08.70]Behold what our God is revealing;
[01:13.22]He guides us each step of the way.
[01:18.38]Our Lord has appointed a trustworthy slave,
[01:21.46]Through whom He gives food in due season.
[02:03.79]The light of the truth has grown brighter with time,
[02:07.95]Appealing to heart and to reason.
[02:11.55]Our path ever clearer, our steps ever firm,
[02:15.51]We walk in the brightness of day.
[02:19.29]All thanks to Jehovah, the Source of all truth,
[02:23.15]We most gratefully walk in his way.
[02:27.44](Chorus)
[02:27.59]Our path now becomes ever brighter;
[02:31.61]We walk in the full light of day.
[02:37.94]Behold what our God is revealing;
[02:43.60]He guides us each step of the way.
